Reimplementations (no third-party code copied)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The following are our own implementations of published methods. They are
listed for academic attribution, not because any code was reused.

* src/KAN.py — B-spline Kolmogorov-Arnold layer, following
  Liu et al., arXiv:2404.19756 (https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.19756).

* The `cos_cubed` concept loss (src/CBM_model.py) reimplements the concept
  loss of Label-free CBM / CB-LLM, arXiv:2304.06129
  (https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.06129).

